{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive new armour, weapon and Champion cosmetics from your favorite Space Marine chapters and save money on additional Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 content with the Season Pass 2. Content can be downloaded from the store or in-game upon release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immediately available:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Black Templars Champion Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Imperial Fists Cosmetic Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be released:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Blood Angels Champion Pack - scheduled Q4 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Salamanders Cosmetic Pack - scheduled Q4 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Raven Guard Champion Pack - scheduled Q1 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Carcharodons Cosmetic Pack - scheduled Q1 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Iron Hands Chapter Pack - scheduled Q1 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- //REDACTED// Champion Pack - scheduled Q2 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Raptors Cosmetic Pack - scheduled Q2 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requires the base game Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing this bundle makes some of its content unlockable in the customization menu. You can unlock its associated content with requisition points obtained in PvP and PvE modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details, please check the descriptions of each Pack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871320?t=1757006381","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871320/0399c2be6b779ea297fd53b25fe97fbf62f2e61a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757006381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871320/a84314bf10bca3a14cbf9c3b15bc66